 (text "One-cable debugging: USB2514B hub, CP2102N console, flash-mode switch" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "2860a9e8-8d11-5cc3-9136-2a37d868f55a"))
(text "Normal: USB-C -> hub. Port 1 Jetson USB0 (L4T USB networking), port 2 STM32 (VESC Tool), port 3 CP2102N (console)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "7f290248-64ce-5ef0-bc1d-d7acec20adf3"))
(text "FLASH switch: two TS3USB30E connect USB-C straight to Jetson USB0 (NVIDIA asks for a direct link in recovery)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "8e5b8df4-3934-5a87-80bd-5d3d4123f866"))
(text "Hub straps: CFG_SEL = 00 (self-powered, straps on), NON_REM = 11 (ports 1-3 fixed). RBIAS 12.0k 1%." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "8bbc8c56-d652-5e5e-8b64-02317a2db25b"))
(text "VBUS_DET: VBUS can be 20 V after PD, so a 10k + 3.3 V low-current zener clamps it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "bce5c820-3267-5008-bfc1-7506c4ded903"))
